   {
    "id": "x1",
    "text": "Non-inverting amplifier",
    "x": 1200,
    "y": 1200,
    "size": 90,
    "rot": 0
   },
   {
    "id": "x2",
    "text": "Gain = 1 + Rf / Rg = 1 + R2 / R3 = 1 + 100k / 10k = 11   (0.5 V in -> 5.5 V out)\nV1 / V2 make the split +12 V / -12 V supply around GND; V3 is the signal.\nTransient: compare IN and OUT.  AC: flat 20.8 dB gain.",
    "x": 1200,
    "y": 4400,
    "size": 50,
    "rot": 0
   }
  ],
